 "notes": "Act 51 of 2025 created the Women Veterans plate and repealed the Pearl Harbor Survivor plate, though DFA still lists Pearl Harbor. Dyslexia Support is probably from SB555 (2023) but I couldn't confirm its first-issue date, and the painted bunting image is AGFC's share image (filename says 2025). Authorized but not yet on DFA's list: Little Rock Central High (Act 808, 2023) and Make-A-Wish Mid-South (Act 490, 2025). On DFA's list but missing from the game and pre-2023: Municipal Police Association, Civil Air Patrol, Little Rock Air Force Base, National MS Society. DFA list pages have no plate images, though each plate's detail page has one."
